<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{2}R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{2}R</annotation></semantics></math>: Hierarchical Hindsight Reflection for Multi-Task LLM Agents
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">1<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">st</sup> Shicheng Ye
